Stark  ○┌ Help ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
Ask Star│Chat opens ready to type. Enter sends; / opens the command line.                                      │
Type a m│Esc leaves typing. Esc again stops a live run; q asks before quitting.                                │
        │On a page, Esc or q returns to chat.                                                                  │
        │j/k or arrows move · Enter opens or changes · Backspace/← returns to an index                         │
        │The wheel scrolls what is under it · PageUp/PageDown read back while typing                           │
        │Ctrl-N starts a conversation · Ctrl-V dictates · Ctrl-Q quits now                                     │
        │Ctrl-C kill switch · Ctrl-L redraw · x stops the selected run                                         │
        │Cards: y/n confirms · j/k picks · 1-9 answers · i types a free answer                                 │
        │Login: c signs in · d signs out · s sets a key · x removes · K checks                                 │
        │Models: Enter edits or cycles · r refreshes the catalogue                                             │
        │                                                                                                      │
        │slash commands                                                                                        │
        │  /project                                                open the project index                      │
        │  /model    [refresh]                                     configure models or refresh the active catal│
        │  /login                                                  configure connections, keys, and subscriptio│
        │  /settings [section]                                     open all settings or one named section      │
        │  /runs                                                   show work started by this TUI               │
        │  /mind                                                   show the selected run trace                 │
        │  /activity                                               show recent core activity                   │
        │  /chat                                                   return to the conversation                  │
        │  /search   <text>                                        find text in the conversation               │
        │  /nav      <url> <goal> [--headless] [--profile P] [--no-safety]drive a web page to a goal           │
        │  /app      <app> <goal>                                  drive a native application to a goal        │
        │  /ax       trusted|apps|table|press|set|menu|type|key    one direct accessibility call               │
        │  /evals                                                  open the evaluation test index              │
        │  /eval     [--filter F] [--tag T] [--once] [--list]      run the app-control suite                   │
        │  /stop                                                   cancel the selected run                     │
        │  /kill                                                   cancel every live run                       │
        │  /new      [title]                                       start a conversation                        │
        │  /sessions                                               switch conversation                         │
        │  /rename   <title>                                       retitle this conversation                   │
        │  /doctor                                                 re-run readiness checks                     │
        │  /help                                                   show commands and keys                      │
        │  /quit                                                   leave Starkbot Neo                          │
        │  /packs                                                  capability packs — not built yet            │  ▼ live
╭───────│  /soul                                                   edit soul.md — not built yet                │───────╮
│ > / op│  /pause                                                  pause the queue — not built yet             │       │
╰───────│  /resume                                                 resume the queue — not built yet            │───────╯
NORMAL │└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
